**Files changed:** `src/new_grep/new_grep.c`

**Behavior added:** `-h` / `--no-filename` option forces no filename prefix regardless of default rules.

**Last-one-wins resolution:** A single `no_force_filename` flag (set by `-h`) and `force_filename` flag (set by `-H`) are tracked; whichever option appears last on the command line wins, including within combined short-option clusters like `-Hh` or `-hH`.

